    "start": 28.659,
    "end": 37.602,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "So today we're joined with Tashi Tsepal, who is the head of the Nygma lineage of Tibetan Buddhism.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_4",
    "start": 39.123,
    "end": 45.885,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "And we don't have much time today, so we'll make some quick questions and we'll see.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_5",
    "start": 47.305,
    "end": 51.669,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "So right now you're giving the whole cycle of the Ning-Tik-Tsape in the South of France.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_6",
    "start": 53.69,
    "end": 57.513,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "And there's this quote from Dzongsar Khyentse Rinpoche.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_7",
    "start": 57.553,
    "end": 60.315,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "He often says, Vajrayana is custom made for the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_8",
    "start": 61.536,
    "end": 70.583,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "So I wanted to know a little bit about your opinion, if it's so appropriate Vajrayana for the West and how do you see the Volvo also?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
