    "start": 73.217,
    "end": 77.922,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, thank you for having an opportunity to talk with you.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_10",
    "start": 81.105,
    "end": 85.29,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "As you know, I didn't travel that much in the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_11",
    "start": 87.252,
    "end": 93.198,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "As you know, I spent most of the time with the ChabjeDilgo KhyentseRinpoche, but when you travel, I went around.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
