    "start": 93.978,
    "end": 98.36,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "But I never went as an independent teacher giving teaching in the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_13",
    "start": 100.301,
    "end": 107.565,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Now, since a few years I've been traveling a little bit, so I get to know West a little bit.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_14",
