    "start": 113.008,
    "end": 124.715,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "In the past, let's say, maybe 40 years, because when I first came to West West, with everything which is Rinpoche, that is 1970s, something like that.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
