    "start": 129.017,
    "end": 130.898,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "He was so kind to take me wherever he goes.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_19",
    "start": 132.359,
    "end": 146.75,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I see the audience at that time were a lot of the kind of hippies and then people who are looking for some kind of exotic Asian kind of things like that, you know.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
