    "start": 149,
    "end": 152.303,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "But also a lot of serious people also at that time.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_21",
    "start": 152.943,
    "end": 155.945,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Some of them are still alive now, very good practitioner.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_22",
    "start": 156.846,
    "end": 162.21,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "But I've seen general audience, I've seen the changes this past many years.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_23",
    "start": 163.311,
    "end": 172.218,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And I was also thinking like today, you know, some of the Rinpoche, they sort of live their second home in India and come and settle in the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_24",
    "start": 173.178,
    "end": 175.02,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And they're teaching, teaching, teaching, teaching.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_25",
    "start": 176.161,
    "end": 187.732,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, I think they have really managed to kind of really, I think we can say the root, not only Buddhism but especially Tibetan Vajrayana Buddhism kind of rooted in the West.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_26",
    "start": 191.195,
    "end": 194.679,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I mean like, here we have more than 800 people attending.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_27",
    "start": 195.16,
    "end": 197.923,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "For the whole Sangha, this is almost unbelievable.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_28",
    "start": 199.044,
    "end": 203.91,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "If you think back like 25 years ago, or maybe 30 years ago, it's almost unbelievable.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_29",
    "start": 203.97,
    "end": 209.316,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Even someone like Travjitthi Mujhinsa Rinpoche, a great master like Karmapa, not that many people there.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_30",
    "start": 210.397,
    "end": 227.127,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So that we can see the change and also among the audience, a lot of intellectuals, you know, the background Western intellectuals, like scientists, doctors, engineers, and then also like yourself, a lot of young people.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
