    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I still feel so lucky, I was so lucky to be able to be with him.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_64",
    "start": 511.415,
    "end": 513.016,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Because in him, the whole Dharma is there.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_65",
    "start": 515.437,
    "end": 524.404,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Just being with him, even if he doesn't speak, just being with him and his life, it is the kind of perfect example of Dharma.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_66",
    "start": 525.245,
    "end": 529.148,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Example, the way he looks at the situations.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_67",
    "start": 530.328,
    "end": 534.832,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And no matter what situation, he is always, I think the simple language, we can always come.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_68",
    "start": 536.752,
    "end": 542.313,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Even at one point we were travelling in a helicopter and there was a bad weather and the plane was shaking.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_69",
    "start": 542.393,
    "end": 547.014,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Even the pilot's face was kind of nervous and I'm chicken, I'm so scared.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_70",
    "start": 547.495,
    "end": 551.035,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "But he was just smiling and reciting his mantra and looking at us.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_71",
    "start": 551.535,
    "end": 555.996,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "He's sort of more worried about we getting worried and he was not worried.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_72",
    "start": 557.036,
    "end": 557.657,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Things like that.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_73",
    "start": 557.757,
    "end": 564.878,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And also, so that kind of shows that the freedom, the freedom inside and these things being with him really inspires.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_74",
    "start": 566.681,
    "end": 573.312,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And Khyentse Rinpoche really cared so much about Dharma, you know, after he left.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_75",
    "start": 573.733,
    "end": 578.521,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Actually this little bit long story, but I think when he left Tibet, he felt",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_76",
    "start": 580.827,
    "end": 596.615,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "kind of a little bit of hopelessness, kind of, because many masters couldn't make it out, and there are many books that have been lost, the teachings within, especially when you heard Jamaican's past, that was really, really hard for him, I think.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_77",
    "start": 598.816,
    "end": 615.282,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Then, when he went back to seek him, and he met somebody who was very close to Jamyang Khyentse Chokyi Lodroe, and that person was told the story when he met Jamyang Khyentse Chokyi Lodroe before he passed away.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_78",
    "start": 616.542,
    "end": 620.663,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So this person went to see Jamyang Khyentse Chokyi Lodroe, and Chokyi Lodroe was bedridden.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_79",
    "start": 621.764,
    "end": 625.585,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I think it was his last kind of bedridden, and then he cried in front of him.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_80",
    "start": 626.445,
    "end": 628.547,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And Chokyi Lodroe just sort of got up and said, why are you crying?",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_81",
    "start": 628.907,
    "end": 631.288,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And he said, well, now this is the end of it.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_82",
    "start": 631.388,
    "end": 634.17,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "You know, you are in very bad situation.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_83",
    "start": 634.19,
    "end": 641.235,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I mean, you are like passing into Paranirvana and many Lamas couldn't make it and we lost, I think this is the end of the Dharma.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_84",
    "start": 642.595,
    "end": 645.597,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And Chokyi Lodroe just sort of pulled himself up and he said, don't worry.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_85",
    "start": 645.858,
    "end": 647.459,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I heard Dingu Chen said, made it to Bhutan.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_86",
    "start": 648.159,
    "end": 649.1,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "He will take care of it.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_87",
    "start": 650.22,
    "end": 656.167,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So when this story was told to Khyentse Rinpoche by this gentleman, he said, before Khyentse should have passed away, I hid this story.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_88",
    "start": 656.608,
    "end": 659.951,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Then Khyentse Rinpoche sort of regored in courage, I think.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_89",
    "start": 660.051,
    "end": 662.414,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I felt, oh, my guru really entrusted me.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_90",
    "start": 662.834,
    "end": 663.815,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I must do something.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_91",
    "start": 664.396,
    "end": 668.34,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So from there onwards, he non-stop teaching and wherever he was invited,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_92",
    "start": 669.181,
    "end": 671.144,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Actually he never said no to any teaching.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_93",
    "start": 672.225,
    "end": 681.077,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "No matter what time, early morning, late evening, no matter how big the tax is, and no matter how many people there, he always continued giving teaching.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_94",
    "start": 681.838,
    "end": 683.921,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So that's how he really cared about Dharma.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_95",
    "start": 685.688,
    "end": 686.788,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "A bit like you now.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_96",
    "start": 688.769,
    "end": 690.89,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I have to have a massage and I have to relax.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_97",
    "start": 691.25,
    "end": 692.01,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "It's not like that.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
