    "start": 709.475,
    "end": 713.957,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Interviewer",
    "text": "Yes, thank you again for the cycle of empowerment and coming on this podcast.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_103",
    "start": 715.327,
    "end": 716.008,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Okay, thank you.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_104",
    "start": 716.288,
    "end": 720.611,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I think we have to use this modern platform, you know, to encourage people.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_105",
    "start": 721.371,
    "end": 732.779,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "Of course, I don't mean to convert people, but you know, make it make it teachings available because there are so many people who really thirst for this kind of teaching, authentic teachings, so they don't get the opportunity.",
