    "start": 732.899,
    "end": 744.527,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think we are using modern platform and then the young people like yourself really has to work hard to make this teaching valuable and then keep it for the future generation.",
